{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"{\n  \"additions\": [\n    {\n      \"unit_key\": \"Ch1:1\",\n      \"studies\": [\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供多界微生物组（细菌+真菌+古菌+病毒）整合分析证据，证实高多样性及特定属组合与ICI疗效正相关，补充单一细菌视角的局限，支撑“生态网络稳定性促进疗效”的观点。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0364\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提出“功能趋同”理论框架，解释分类学不一致背后的共享免疫通路（如SCFA产生、DC激活），为跨队列异质性提供机制整合视角，支持向基于功能的生物标志物开发转型。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0437\",\n          \"contribution\": \"展示基因水平微生物丰度结合生物先验知识在预测ICI反应中优于传统分类学特征，揭示治疗策略（联合免疫阻断vs单药）对微生物信号泛化性的修饰作用，丰富标志物开发的维度。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_key\": \"Ch1:2\",\n      \"studies\": [\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0339\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供大样本荟萃分析数据，量化PPI使用与ICI生存结局恶化的关联，并细化使用时窗（基线/前60天 vs 同期）的效应差异，为讨论药物暴露的时间依赖性干扰提供流行病学基准。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0360\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供妇科肿瘤真实世界数据，明确抗生素使用时长（≥14天）与OS显著缩短的独立关联，区分短期反应指标与长期生存获益的差异，强化用药阈值效应的临床证据。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0421\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供肌肉量这一非微生物宿主因素对ICI疗效影响的实证数据，显示低肌肉量在肺癌中未降低PFS且不增加毒性，作为对比背景说明除菌群外其他宿主因素的预测价值存在异质性。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_key\": \"Ch1:3\",\n      \"studies\": [\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0415\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供人类黑色素瘤患者宏基因组与宏转录组联合分析证据，识别与PFS相关的特定代谢通路（氨基酸合成、维生素合成）及其转录活性，为纵向动态变化提供分子层面的候选机制线索。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0443\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供NSCLC物种水平微生物特征与PFS及PD-L1状态的关联数据，证实化疗预处理虽扰动菌群但不消除特异性预测信号，支持动态监测中治疗史独立性的论证。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0485\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供黏膜黑色素瘤前瞻性队列初步数据，揭示响应者与非响应者肠道菌群组成差异及肿瘤微环境CD56/CD20表达平行变化，补充罕见实体瘤亚型中纵向生态重塑的早期实证。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_key\": \"Ch1:4\",\n      \"studies\": [\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0387\",\n          \"contribution\": \"系统对比三类微生物干预措施（益生菌vs菌群组合vs FMT）的临床结局，指出FMT在难治性肿瘤中表现较一致ORR提升而益生菌效果高度特异，支撑“干预复杂度决定疗效”的证据阶梯判断。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供肺癌幸存者长期随访数据，通过地标分析校正时间偏倚，揭示获益者特有的紧凑微生物网络与丁酸高产能力，以及irAEs患者的分子模拟表位富集，界定概念验证阶段向常规应用转化的现实边界。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0470\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供涵盖特定菌属富集、抗生素暴露及FMT效果的定量荟萃分析结果，汇总群体水平的统计关联证据，用于评估当前证据等级及未来标准化需求的核心素材。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}","reasoning_content":"Here's a thinking process:\n\n1.  **Analyze User Input:**\n    - **Role:** Academic Review Planning Editor.\n    - **Goal:** Create a long-form review with a clear argumentative主线 (main thread). Plan substantive content in Chinese. Keep original paper titles/proper nouns. Do not write Q&A lists.\n    - **Constraints:**\n        - Opening, scope declaration, abstract, and final summary are handled by independent modules *after* the main body is written. Do not plan them as chapters/units here.\n        - Background, concepts, theory teaching, mechanisms, method comparisons, and future research directions with specific problems/analysis belong to the main body and should be fully expanded as needed.\n        - Each chapter/unit must have a clear knowledge question or analytical task, not just intro/conclusion.\n        - Chapter organization & comparison scale determined by research question, disciplinary context, existing materials. No single paradigm forced. Theory/method/design organized by actual argument structure.\n        - Center on user's research question: \"How does the gut microbiome modulate the efficacy of immune checkpoint inhibitors in solid tumours, and what mechanisms mediate that effect?\"\n        - Propose an organizing perspective & synthetic judgment贯穿全文. Let different sources承担解释、比较、例证、背景或发展等职责. Do not summarize paper-by-paper. Don't let a local gap replace the main thread. Synthetic judgment must be supported by material connections/differences/evolution.\n        - Judge relevance based on RQ & materials. Don't trust promotional claims; focus on actual objects/settings/methods/results/arguments/validation/boundaries.\n        - Preserve real study types, objects, settings, conditions, methods, results, limits for each source. Review's synthesis/hypotheses/schemes are NOT observed results.\n        - Original research & direct sources have equal substantive use when relevant. Keep metadata/R# namespaces. Use `source_handle` if available. Short handle mapping done locally.\n        - Use broad materials when evidence is sufficient, but don't force-fill. Distinguish association vs causation, mechanism/explanation, migration/application, validation/uncertainty. Don't mistake correlation/support for causal mechanism/cross-setting migration/independent validation.\n        - Limited supplementary retrieval != field lacks research/better routes. Unmet needs only constrain this writing round, don't upgrade to field-level lack judgments, don't let same gap dominate multiple chapters. Only describe range supported by existing materials, correct overstatements. Route summary vs interpretation_limits conflict -> prioritize limits.\n        - Research conditions must enter `substantive_point`, `thesis`, `synthesis`, `transition`. Objects/settings随主张/案例/展开关系陈述，不堆进独立limit字段。Don't patch overclaims with separate limitation fields. Don't require condition tables for every sentence or uniform \"possibly\".\n        - For different objects/settings/scales, preserve non-equivalence, don't rank effects unconditionally. Chapter titles in Chinese.\n        - Return JSON only.\n    - **Task:** Pick available literature cases for already coordinated writing units. Read all `source_routing` & `source_materials`, compare with `unit_catalog`, pick materials that truly support the unit's objects, results, conditions, or useful contrasts. Target ~150-200 independent lit for the whole review (not per chapter/batch). Quality target, not quota. Don't repeat existing sources, don't force irrelevant ones, don't treat \"few core papers\" as a rule. Only supplement specific units, don't change chapter structure. New papers must add different results, conditions, methods, development stages, or useful contrasts compared to existing `cases/supporting_studies`. If only repeats same generalization, leave in pool, `additions` can be empty. Write `contribution`: ~30-60 words explaining what this material helps explain in this unit (specific writing purpose), can propose proposed synthesis. This text is specific writing purpose, NOT paper results. Methods/results/conclusions must come from attached A/B, close reading, or supplements. Recommended uses cannot say analogies/schemes/other objects' results as direct empirical evidence for this problem. `material_available` false means no actual content, don't fabricate. Current call only responsible for one `chapter_id`; complete routing may be chunked, don't fabricate missing sources.\n    - **Output Contract:** `{\"chapter_id\": \"Ch1\", \"bounded_unit_count\": 4, ...}` -> Return JSON object: `additions` array, each `unit_key`, `studies` array (`source_handle`, `contribution`).\n    - **Input Data:** `unit_catalog` has 4 units for Ch1:\n        - U1: 跨癌种关联图谱 (Pan-cancer association map)\n        - U2: 外部干扰与宿主背景 (External interference & host background)\n        - U3: 动态监测与纵向演变 (Dynamic monitoring & longitudinal evolution)\n        - U4: 证据阶梯与转化边界 (Evidence ladder & translation boundaries)\n    - I need to select new studies from the provided `source_materials` (P0333 to P0487) that fit these units, ensuring they add value beyond what's already in `supporting_studies` for each unit. I will carefully check existing `supporting_studies` to avoid duplicates and ensure new picks bring distinct results, conditions, methods, or contrasts.\n\n2.  **Analyze Existing Cases & Supporting Studies per Unit:**\n    - **U1 (跨癌种关联图谱):** Already has P0096, P0146, P0585, P0478, P0170, P0015, P0298, P0204, P0289, P0270. Focus: Pan-cancer signals, heterogeneity, lack of universal marker, cohort dependency, treatment modification.\n    - **U2 (外部干扰与宿主背景):** Already has P0081, P0402, P0585, P0123, P0157, P0033, P0236, P0266, P0289, P0275. Focus: Antibiotics/PPIs time windows, dose dependence, indication bias, combination therapy modification, correction necessity.\n    - **U3 (动态监测与纵向演变):** Already has P0569, P0585, P0584, P0273, P0033, P0134, P0098, P0227, P0200, P0205, P0327. Focus: Baseline snapshot limits, longitudinal dynamics (pathogen clearance/colonization failure), predictive value, sampling challenges/standardization.\n    - **U4 (证据阶梯与转化边界):** Already has P0583, P0584, P0578, P0273, P0026, P0144, P0161, P0260, P0291. Focus: Observational strength, FMT hope vs heterogeneity, MITRIC negative trial, Phase III blank, safety signals context-dependence.\n\n3.  **Select New Sources for Each Unit (Aim: ~15-20 total across 4 units, ensuring quality & distinctness):**\n    I will scan the provided `source_materials` for highly relevant, high-quality empirical or review papers that fill gaps or provide strong contrasts/new angles for each unit.\n\n    *Unit 1: 跨癌种关联图谱 (Pan-cancer associations)*\n    - Need: Strong pan-cancer or multi-cohort data showing taxonomic/functional associations, highlighting cancer-type specificity or functional convergence.\n    - Candidates: P0393 (Multi-Kingdom Gut Microbiome Interaction Characteristics Predict ICI Efficacy Across Pan-Cancer Cohorts) - Excellent for pan-cancer, multi-kingdom, network stability. P0400 (Precision microbiome mapping identifies signature predictive across cohorts) - Good for cross-cohort validation, though limited to melanoma/NSCLC/RCC. P0364 (Functional convergence amid taxonomic variability) - Good for explaining inconsistencies via functional pathways. P0437 (Gene-level gut microbiome signatures predictive across multiple cancer types) - Good for gene-level vs taxonomy, CICB vs monotherapy context.\n    - Selection: P0393, P0364, P0437.\n    - Contributions drafting:\n        - P0393: 提供多界微生物组（细菌+真菌+古菌+病毒）整合分析证据，证实高多样性及特定属组合（如拟杆菌属与克鲁维酵母属）与ICI疗效正相关，补充单一细菌视角的局限，支撑“生态网络稳定性促进疗效”的观点。\n        - P0364: 提出“功能趋同”理论框架，解释分类学不一致背后的共享免疫通路（如SCFA产生、DC激活），为跨队列异质性提供机制整合视角，支持向基于功能的生物标志物开发转型。\n        - P0437: 展示基因水平微生物丰度结合生物先验知识在预测ICI反应中优于传统分类学特征，揭示治疗策略（联合免疫阻断vs单药）对微生物信号泛化性的修饰作用，丰富标志物开发的维度。\n\n    *Unit 2: 外部干扰与宿主背景 (External interference & host background)*\n    - Need: Data on antibiotics, P","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1791151047,"id":"chatcmpl-6f841f45-ab7d-9625-9684-5072b7b301ab","model":"qwen3.7-flash","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":3055,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":2048,"text_tokens":3055},"prompt_tokens":219838,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"text_tokens":219838},"total_tokens":222893}}